  <h3 class="title">Weather Reporting Made Easy - Release 2</h3>
  <div class="section">
    <p>
      Welcome to Weather Reporting Made Easy Release 2! You can now sign up and log in, manage your own weather stations, and view detailed weather reports complete with icons. Sessions keep you logged in securely.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features include:
      <ul>
        <li>Member sign-up and login</li>
